1
00:00:00,589 --> 00:00:03,349
(Penny:)...because it would be floating
in a weightless environment.

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:06,829
(Penny:)Yeah, that's right,
the slow reader used science. Suck on that.

3
00:00:10,066 --> 00:00:14,626
- Was there anything valuable in the car?
- Our clothes, our wallets, phones.

4
00:00:14,837 --> 00:00:16,357
And about $300 worth of makeup...

5
00:00:16,572 --> 00:00:19,632
(Raj:)...so this thief could look like
anyone right now.

6
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:23,800
(Policeman:)Makeup? Sure.

7
00:00:26,649 --> 00:00:31,179
(Leonard:)We're going to the Comic-Con in Bakersfield.
They have a big costume contest.

8
00:00:31,387 --> 00:00:33,547
(Leonard:)It's cooler than it sounds.

9
00:00:34,857 --> 00:00:37,227
(Policeman:)I don't know, sounds pretty cool.

10
00:00:39,028 --> 00:00:40,728
(Raj:)It is. It's not just comic books.

11
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:44,160
(Raj:)They've got action figures,
toys, a Tron themed dance party...

12
00:00:44,367 --> 00:00:46,197
(Leonard:)Okay, he gets how cool it is.

13
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,333
(Policeman:)I think I have all I need here.
You guys need me to call someone?

14
00:00:50,539 --> 00:00:52,909
(Policeman:)I'm guessing your moms?

15
00:00:55,544 --> 00:00:57,174
(Leonard:)Thanks, but we've got it covered.

16
00:00:57,380 --> 00:01:04,020
(Howard:)Okay, I just talked to my mom.

